entries[22476] = { ["name"] = "Bonescythe Breastplate", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n262 Armor\n+29 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Rogue\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 2%.\nEquip: +80 Attack Power.\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit by 1%.\n\nBonescythe Armor (0/9)\nBonescythe Bracers\nBonescythe Breastplate\nBonescythe Gauntlets\nBonescythe Helmet\nBonescythe Legplates\nBonescythe Pauldrons\nBonescythe Sabatons\nBonescythe Waistguard\nBonescythe Ring\n(2) Set : Your normal melee swings have a chance to Invigorate you, healing you for 90 to 110.\n(4) Set : Your Backstab, Sinister Strike, and Hemorrhage critical hits cause you to regain 5 energy. (500ms cooldown)\n(6) Set : Reduces the threat from your Backstab, Sinister Strike, Hemorrhage, and Eviscerate abilities.\n(8) Set : Your Eviscerate has a chance per combo point to reveal a flaw in your opponent's armor, granting a 100% critical hit chance for your next Backstab, Sinister Strike, or Hemorrhage." }
